WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:04.000
Watch first. Sit supported.
Keep your heel supported.

00:04.000 --> 00:10.000
Gently lift and lower the toes.
Use only a comfortable range.

00:10.000 --> 00:14.000
Relax your foot and rest.
Replaying is optional.

00:14.000 --> 00:20.000
Watch the small movement again.
Your movement may look different.

00:20.000 --> 00:24.000
Pause. Notice comfort and fatigue.
No height or repetition target.

00:24.000 --> 00:30.000
A final example, at normal speed.
Stop if it causes discomfort.

00:30.000 --> 00:36.000
Return to rest.
Record how it felt, if you wish.
